	(text "JFOX-FMU v1 - SENSORS\nThree IMUs on three separate SPI buses, each on its own switchable rail.\nOne sensor hanging its bus must not take the other two with it.\n\nWARNING - before dropping any +3V3_IMUn rail, firmware must drive that\nbus's SCK/MOSI/CS low. Interface pins held high with VDDIO off destroy\nthese parts through their ESD diodes (BMP388 datasheet 3.2)."
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6a019f9a-8589-431f-8bb7-8022739ee654")
	)
